meta {
  name: One meeting's status and, when ready, its encrypted brief with the caller's own key wraps
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/meetings/:id
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  id: 
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Absent, expired, removed, declined and never-attended meetings all answer 404 `not_found`. The brief (summary, decisions, action items, open questions and transcript) is AES-256-GCM ciphertext; each `keys` entry wraps the content key for one of the caller's notes keys (ECDH P-256 + HKDF-SHA256 + AES-256-GCM, docs/meeting-summaries.md).
}
